   {
    "id": "n10_note",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     0,
     1000
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "### Parts of a whole\n\n**Treemap** and **pie** were not reachable before \u2014 they take a\n*hierarchy*, or *labels and values*, rather than x and y, which is why\nthose boxes replace X and Y when you pick them.\n\nThe treemap nests city inside region from one **Hierarchy** field. The pie\nis a donut, which is the **Hole** setting.",
     "width": 760,
     "height": 240
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "n11_from",
    "type": "flograph.util.goto_from",
    "pos": [
     0,
     1640
    ],
    "params": {
     "source": "n02_goto"
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "n12_treemap",
    "type": "flograph.viz.show_plotly",
    "pos": [
     400,
     1340
    ],
    "params": {
     "kind": "treemap",
     "path": "region,city",
     "values": "revenue",
     "color": "revenue",
     "color_scale": "Blues",
     "more": true,
     "title": "Revenue by region and city",
     "width": 440,
     "height": 320
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "Treemap"
   },
   {
    "id": "n13_pie",
    "type": "flograph.viz.show_plotly",
    "pos": [
     400,
     1820
    ],
    "params": {
     "kind": "pie",
     "names": "category",
     "values": "revenue",
     "hole": 0.45,
     "title": "Share by category",
     "width": 440,
     "height": 320
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "Donut"
   },
   {
    "id": "n20_note",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     0,
     2360
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "### Distributions\n\nA **box** plot and a **histogram**. Leave the columns blank on either and\nit charts every numeric column \u2014 along X, not up Y, because a histogram\n*of* a column is what the word means.\n\nEach carries settings only it has: **Points** (all / outliers / none) on\nthe box, **Bins** and a **Marginal plot** on the histogram. Both are\nunder More options.",
     "width": 760,
     "height": 260
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "n21_from",
    "type": "flograph.util.goto_from",
    "pos": [
     0,
     3020
    ],
    "params": {
     "source": "n02_goto"
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "n22_box",
    "type": "flograph.viz.show_plotly",
    "pos": [
     400,
     2720
    ],
    "params": {
     "kind": "box",
     "x": "category",
     "y": "revenue",
     "color": "category",
     "points": "all",
     "more": true,
     "title": "Revenue spread",
     "width": 440,
     "height": 320
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "Box"
   },
   {
    "id": "n23_hist",
    "type": "flograph.viz.show_plotly",
    "pos": [
     400,
     3200
    ],
    "params": {
     "kind": "histogram",
     "x": "revenue",
     "nbins": 8,
     "marginal": "rug",
     "more": true,
     "title": "How revenue is distributed",
     "width": 440,
     "height": 320
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "Histogram"
   },
   {
    "id": "n30_note",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     0,
     3740
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "### Encodings and facets\n\nOne scatter carrying four variables at once: cost across, revenue up,\n**Size by** units and **Color by** category \u2014 then **Facet columns by**\nregion splits it into a panel per region sharing both axes.\n\nSize, symbol, dash, pattern, text and hover columns all live under More\noptions.",
     "width": 760,
     "height": 240
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "n31_from",
    "type": "flograph.util.goto_from",
    "pos": [
     0,
     4260
    ],
    "params": {
     "source": "n02_goto"
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "n32_scatter",
    "type": "flograph.viz.show_plotly",
    "pos": [
     400,
     4080
    ],
    "params": {
     "kind": "scatter",
     "x": "cost",
     "y": "revenue",
     "size": "units",
     "color": "category",
     "facet_col": "region",
     "more": true,
     "hover_name": "city",
     "title": "Cost against revenue, by region",
     "width": 760,
     "height": 380
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "Faceted scatter"
   },
   {
    "id": "n40_note",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     0,
     4680
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "### Style, without touching the chart\n\nThe **bar chart** on the left is plain. Wired into **Plotly Style**, the\nsame figure comes out themed, with the legend on top, thousands separators\nup the Y axis, the regions sorted by total, a dashed **reference line** at\nthe target and a note in the corner.\n\nCompare the two cards. Every setting on the style node has a **keep**\nposition and that is the default, so it changes only what you actually\nset \u2014 which is why it is safe to drop in front of a chart somebody else\nbuilt, a Gantt chart included.",
     "width": 760,
     "height": 320
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "n41_from",
    "type": "flograph.util.goto_from",
    "pos": [
     0,
     5260
    ],
    "params": {
     "source": "n02_goto"
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "n42_bar",
    "type": "flograph.viz.show_plotly",
    "pos": [
     400,
     5100
    ],
    "params": {
     "kind": "bar",
     "x": "region",
     "y": "revenue",
     "color": "category",
     "barmode": "group",
     "title": "Revenue by region",
     "width": 440,
     "height": 340
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "Bar (plain)"
   },
   {
    "id": "n43_style",
    "type": "flograph.viz.plotly_style",
    "pos": [
     1100,
     5100
    ],
    "params": {
     "template": "plotly_white",
     "legend_pos": "top",
     "y_format": ",.0f",
     "y_title": "Revenue (GBP)",
     "grid_x": "off",
     "line_at": "6000",
     "line_label": "Target",
     "line_color": "crimson",
     "category_order": "total descending",
     "note": "Target is the FY26 regional plan.",
     "note_pos": "top left",
     "more": true,
     "width": 460,
     "height": 340
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "Bar (styled)"
   },
   {
    "id": "n50_note",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     0,
     5660
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "### A table that matches the charts\n\nPlotly Express has no table function, so **Plotly Table** is its own node,\nbuilt on `go.Table`. It is not the node for *reading* data \u2014 Show Table is\nfar better at that \u2014 it is for when a table has to look like the charts\nbeside it: same theme, same fonts, and it snapshots into a report or PDF\nthe same way a chart does.\n\n**Number format** takes a d3 format and applies it to the numeric columns\nonly, leaving the words alone.",
     "width": 760,
     "height": 300
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "n51_from",
    "type": "flograph.util.goto_from",
    "pos": [
     0,
     6220
    ],
    "params": {
     "source": "n02_goto"
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "n52_table",
    "type": "flograph.viz.plotly_table",
    "pos": [
     400,
     6060
    ],
    "params": {
     "columns": "region,city,category,units,revenue",
     "number_format": ",.0f",
     "striped": true,
     "template": "plotly_white",
     "max_rows": 12,
     "title": "Sales detail",
     "width": 560,
     "height": 340
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "Plotly Table"
   },
   {
    "id": "n60_note",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     0,
     6620
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "### One chart per value\n\n**Chart per Value (Plotly)** offers the same 28 chart kinds and the same\nsettings as Show Plotly \u2014 it just draws one per distinct value of the\n**Split by** column and returns the whole stack.\n\n**Same Y scale** bounds every panel by the whole table so they can be\ncompared by eye. **Columns**, **Rows** and **Fill** arrange the stack and\nare cosmetic, so re-arranging never re-runs the split.",
     "width": 760,
     "height": 280
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "n61_from",
    "type": "flograph.util.goto_from",
    "pos": [
     0,
     7180
    ],
    "params": {
     "source": "n02_goto"
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "n62_per_value",
    "type": "flograph.viz.chart_per_value_plotly",
    "pos": [
     400,
     7000
    ],
    "params": {
     "split_by": "region",
     "kind": "bar",
     "x": "category",
     "y": "revenue",
     "color": "category",
     "shared_scale": true,
     "columns": 3,
     "direction": "across",
     "title": "Revenue",
     "width": 760,
     "height": 400
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "One chart per region"
   }
